<item>
            <title>[LU-20943] access outside of allocated memory in lnet</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20943</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity-lnet tests 210/211 caused an&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469308] ==================================================================&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469326] BUG: KASAN: slab-out-of-bounds in lnet_debug_recovery_show_dump+0x13d2/0x13e0 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;lnet&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469439] Write of size 8 at addr ffff88810489e828 by task lt-lnetctl/19024&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469444]&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469447] CPU: 0 PID: 19024 Comm: lt-lnetctl Tainted: G OE ------- &#8212; 5.14.0-503.40.1.el9_5.x86_64+debug #1&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469452] Hardware name: Red Hat KVM/RHEL, BIOS 1.17.0-1.el10.alma.1 06/10/2025&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469454] Call Trace:&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469457] &amp;lt;TASK&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469460] ? lnet_debug_recovery_show_dump+0x13d2/0x13e0 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;lnet&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
[ 1110.469535] dump_stack_lvl+0x57/0x81&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;this panic caused a wrong buffer size allocation.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
